Panda is a fork of hexo-theme-butterfly 5.7.0 with modifications.
Files modified from the original carry a notice in their header comments;
files added by Panda are marked as new. Major changes include:

- Memos (碎碎念) enhancements: per-memo Giscus comment iframes, comment-count
  auto-expansion, local-search injection, standalone memo pages, latest-memo card
- Atom feed generator mixing posts and memos, with update-notification entries
- OG share image generator (SVG → PNG via @resvg/resvg-js)
- Config-driven gradient visual signature
- Home page can render an arbitrary source page (e.g. the about page)
- Blog series: `_posts/<folder>/index.md` metadata + sibling chapters as one
  card on the post stream (distinct from Butterfly's `{% series %}` tag)
- Rebranding: package name, terminal banner, footer credit, default avatar icon

